"The MagiPhysical Education building is Celena North High's cement-block combat training hall."
"Its grounds include the MagiPhys Lawn and the MagiPhys Track with glowing lanes and hurdles."
"The MagiPhys Gym inside was built by Artonans and is unbreakable."
"When the gym is set 'Floor On', its protections block serious harm to anyone connected."
"Pain in the gym feels real but wears off in ten seconds or less."
"Injury realism is set between 40% and 75%, and can go to no reduction at all."
"The gym registers 'kills', colors rank letters by force allowed, and raises light walls."
"Dueling blocks divide the gym floor for one-on-one fights."
"Students wear gray self-sealing bodysuits with red-inlaid metal bands to connect to it."
"The track is unprotected; a boy lost a tooth there."
"A lethal hit must be proven an accident, or the student is expelled from every Apex school."
"Hero-track admission tests, duels and rescue games are held here."
